  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering climate-vulnerable women workers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to promoting the workers&apos; rights to decent work conditions&#xA0;for climate-vulnerable women workers and facilitating access to social security to enhance their empowerment. This project will be implementing in Bagerhat&apos;s (Piljang and Lakhpur Union under Fakirhat Upazilla) under Khula division through our partner Karmojibi&#xA0;Nari.
This project target participants are the workers, especially women of Sea fish processing and Agricultural workers residing in the Fakirhat Upazila under the Bagerhat District. Although these workers may work in different factories located in different areas like Fakirhat and Bagerhat Sadar under the Bagerhat district, and Rupsa Upazilla under the Khulna district, they are considered the target group of the Project, as they live in Fakirhat Upazilla. The related government bodies/agencies, LGI, Trade Unions/Federation members, Members of Parliament (MPs), owners/employers, media, relevant NGOs/CBOs, and political parties/leaders will also be stakeholders of the project.</narrative>
  </description>
